  Description: A wall of confidence blunts every arrow seeking to pierce your mind.
    Your proficiency rank for Will saves increases to legendary. When you roll a
    success at a Will save, you get a critical success. When you roll a critical
    failure at a Will save, you get a failure instead. When you fail a Will save
    against a damaging effect, you take half damage.
